// the pages typed helpers. It runs at build time only (in page frontmatter), never in the browser.
//
// THE CONTENT IS NEW WORDING, FOR ATHENA TO REVIEW BEFORE LAUNCH. Everything in src/data/nostos/ was
// generated by Claude from YouTube auto-captions, Whisper transcripts and her readable writings, in
// the same spirit as the note at the top of src/data/lemmas.ts. Treat it as data: do not rewrite it
// here, and do not edit those files (another session is still adding to them).
//
// The star map's positions come from src/data/nostos-layout.json, made by scripts/nostos-layout.mjs
// (run before every build), so the browser never runs a layout simulation.
